<doc id="96881" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=96881" title="UNetbootin">
UNetbootin

UNetbootin (Universal Netboot Installer) inggih punika prangkat kanggé ndamèl sistem Live USB. Perangkat ingkang cross-platform punika (saged dipunginaakèn ing pinten-pinten sistem operasi) saged ndamèl pinten-pinten macèm prangkat sistem (system utilities) utawi meng-install pinten-pinten distro Linux utawi sistem operasi sanès meski tanpa CD.
<h2>Ciri</h2>
<h3>USB Install Mode</h3>
Ciri.
USB Install Mode.
Instalasi punika ndamèl &lt;a href="USB%20flash%20drive"&gt;USB flash drive&lt;/a&gt; lan USB &lt;a href="Hard%20Disk%20Drive"&gt;Hard Disk Drive&lt;/a&gt; dados &lt;a href="bootable"&gt;bootable&lt;/a&gt;; utawi, kaliyan tèmbung sansè, ndamèl &lt;a href="Live%20USB"&gt;Live USB&lt;/a&gt;.
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Cross-platform"&gt;Cross-platform&lt;/a&gt; (kasedia kanggé Windows lan Linux)</li>
<li>Instalasi boten ngrusak (boten mem-format prangkat ingkang dipunginaakén) ngginakaken &lt;a href="Syslinux"&gt;Syslinux&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Mendukung distro-distro Linux utama, kalébét nanging mbotén winates atas, &lt;a href="Ubuntu%20%28operating%20system%29"&gt;Ubuntu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fedora%20%28operating%20system%29"&gt;Fedora&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="openSUSE"&gt;openSUSE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="CentOS"&gt;CentOS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Debian"&gt;Debian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Linux%20Mint"&gt;Linux Mint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arch%20Linux"&gt;Arch Linux&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mandriva%20Linux"&gt;Mandriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Slackware"&gt;Slackware&lt;/a&gt; ugi &lt;a href="FreeDOS"&gt;FreeDOS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="FreeBSD"&gt;FreeBSD&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="NetBSD"&gt;NetBSD&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Saged muat dados system utilities, kalebet, nanging boten kawates atas, &lt;a href="Ophcrack"&gt;Ophcrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="BackTrack"&gt;BackTrack&lt;/a&gt;, dan &lt;a href="Gujin"&gt;Gujin&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Sistem operasi sanès saged dipunmuat nglampahi &lt;a href="ISO%20image"&gt;ISO image&lt;/a&gt; utawi &lt;a href="Kernel%20%28computer%20science%29"&gt;kernel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="initrd"&gt;initrd&lt;/a&gt; lan floppy/hard drive &lt;a href="disk%20image"&gt;disk image&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Secara otomatis ngenali sadaya prangkat keras ingkang saged dipunpisahaken (removable devices).</li>
<h3>Hard Drive Install Mode</h3>
</ul>
Hard Drive Install Mode.
Instalasi punika dipunlampahi kaliyan nglampahi jaringan (network installation) utawi "frugal install" boten ngginakaken CD, sami kaliyan cara makarya &lt;a href="Win32-loader%20%28Debian%29"&gt;Win32-Loader&lt;/a&gt;.
Ciri kas UNetbootin inggih punika dukunganipun atas pinten-pinten distro Linux, portabilitas, kabetahan kanggé muat &lt;a href="Kernel%20%28computer%20science%29"&gt;kernel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="initrd"&gt;initial ramdisk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="disk%20image"&gt;disk image&lt;/a&gt; (kalebet &lt;a href="ISO%20image"&gt;ISO image&lt;/a&gt;) ingkang dipuntemtuaken sadèrèngipun, lan dukunganipun atas Windows lan Linux. Boten kados ta &lt;a href="Wubi%20%28Ubuntu%29"&gt;Wubi&lt;/a&gt;, lan sami kaliyan &lt;a href="Win32-loader%20%28Debian%29"&gt;Win32-Loader&lt;/a&gt;, manawi ing-instal ing hard disk, UNetbootin ing-instal ing sebuah &lt;a href="Disk%20partitioning"&gt;partisi&lt;/a&gt;, boten &lt;a href="disk%20image"&gt;disk image&lt;/a&gt;, pramila saged ndamel &lt;a href="dual-boot"&gt;dual-boot&lt;/a&gt; antawis Linux lan Windows.
