Charles G. Dawes

Charles Gates Dawes miyos ing &lt;a href="Marietta%2C%20Ohio"&gt;Marietta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Washington%20County%20%28Ohio%29"&gt;Washington County&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ohio"&gt;Ohio&lt;/a&gt;, nalika &lt;a href="27"&gt;27&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1865"&gt;1865&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun lulus saking &lt;a href="Marietta%20College"&gt;Marietta College&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1884"&gt;1884&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Cincinnati%20Law%20School"&gt;Cincinnati Law School&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1886"&gt;1886&lt;/a&gt;). Lajeng piyambakipun mbikak praktik &lt;a href="pengacara"&gt;pengacara&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Lincoln%2C%20Nebraska"&gt;Lincoln, Nebraska&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1887"&gt;1887&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1894"&gt;1894&lt;/a&gt;).
Garwa saking &lt;a href="Caro%20Dawes"&gt;Caro Blymyer&lt;/a&gt; punika minangka tokoh keuangan lan perbankan ingkang kondhang ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun naté ngrantam konsèp &lt;a href="Rencana%20Dawes"&gt;Rencana Dawes&lt;/a&gt; kanggé rehabilitasi pasca Perang Donya I. kanggé punika piyambakipun pikantuk Bebungah Nobel Bedhamèn.
Charles gadhah 2 putra kandung (&lt;a href="Rufus%20F.%20Dawes"&gt;Rufus F. Dawes&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Carolyn%20Dawes"&gt;Carolyn Dawes&lt;/a&gt;) lan 2 putra angkat (Dena McCutcheon lan Virginia). Nalika taun &lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;, salah satunggaling putranipun, Rufus, ketilem lan tilar donya ing &lt;a href="Danau%20Jenewa"&gt;Danau Jenewa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, nalika kulawarganipun liburan. Saperlu ngenang punika, Dawes damel 2 griya singgah ing &lt;a href="Boston"&gt;Boston&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Chicago"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;.
Dawes naté njabat ing manéka posisi, inggih punika Comptroller Of Currency ing &lt;a href="Departemen%20Keuangan%20AS"&gt;Departemen Keuangan AS&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1898"&gt;1898&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1901"&gt;1901&lt;/a&gt;) ing pundi piyambakipun sukses ngempalaken USD 25 yuta saking bank-bank ingkang kolaps sadangunipun Kepanikan &lt;a href="1893"&gt;1893&lt;/a&gt;, lan ugi ngewahi praktik perbankan saperlu nyegah bab ingkang sami ing samangke. Sabibaripun punika nalika taun &lt;a href="1901"&gt;1901&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun ninggalaken Departemen Keuangan saperlu ngrebut kursi &lt;a href="Senat%20AS"&gt;Senat AS&lt;/a&gt; saking praja &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun yakin kanthi pambiyantu saking papréntahan &lt;a href="William%20McKinley"&gt;William McKinley&lt;/a&gt;, nanging sabibaripun rajapejah tumrap Présidhèn McKinley, upayanipun gagal. Présidhèn &lt;a href="Theodore%20Roosevelt"&gt;Theodore Roosevelt&lt;/a&gt; langkung milih lawan Dawes kanggé kursi Senat punika. Lajeng Dawes langkung milih mandheg saking &lt;a href="pulitik"&gt;pulitik&lt;/a&gt; lan mbiyangun perusahaan &lt;a href="Central%20Trust%20Company%20of%20Illinois"&gt;Central Trust Company of Illinois&lt;/a&gt; lan dados présidhèn direktur dumugi taun &lt;a href="1921"&gt;1921&lt;/a&gt;.
Dawes dipunpilih minangka wakil présidhèn kaping 30 lan njabat antawis &lt;a href="4"&gt;4&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1925"&gt;1925&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="3"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun, piyambakipun dipunangkat minangka &lt;a href="duta%20besar"&gt;duta besar&lt;/a&gt; kanggé &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; (taun &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt;). Piyambakipun rumaos pakaryanipun hina amargi nepangaken wanita-wanita Amérika dhateng Raja Inggris.
Dawes ugi misuwur minangka pancipta komposisi &lt;a href="Melody%20in%20A%20Major"&gt;Melody in A Major&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;. Komposisi punika lajeng kondhang minangka &lt;a href="It%27s%20All%20in%20the%20Game"&gt;It's All in the Game&lt;/a&gt; ing pundi &lt;a href="Carl%20Sigan"&gt;Carl Sigan&lt;/a&gt; nambahaken lirikipun nalika taun &lt;a href="1951"&gt;1951&lt;/a&gt;. Lagu punika dipunbektakaken déning &lt;a href="Tommy%20Edwards"&gt;Tommy Edwards&lt;/a&gt; lan dados hit angka 1 taun &lt;a href="1958"&gt;1958&lt;/a&gt;! Para artis sanès ingkang ugi naté mbektakaken lagu punika kados ta &lt;a href="The%20Four%20Tops"&gt;The Four Tops&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tom%20Morrison"&gt;Tom Morrison&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cliff%20Richards"&gt;Cliff Richards&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brook%20Benton"&gt;Brook Benton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Elton%20John"&gt;Elton John&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Barry%20Manilow"&gt;Barry Manilow&lt;/a&gt;.
Dawes séda ing &lt;a href="Evanston%20%28Illinois%29"&gt;Evanston&lt;/a&gt; nalika 23 &lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1951"&gt;1951&lt;/a&gt; lan dipunsarekaken ing &lt;a href="Chicago"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;.
