<doc id="97183" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=97183" title="Toonami">
Toonami

Toonami ya iku merek dagang kang wis kadaptar ing Cartoon Network, wiwitane minangka blok acara kang orientasine aksi ing saluran &lt;a href="TV"&gt;TV&lt;/a&gt; Cartoon Network ing saben negar, akèh-akèhé &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; nyiarake &lt;a href="kartun"&gt;kartun&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="anime"&gt;anime&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; rikala tanggal &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt; lan rampung tanggal &lt;a href="20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;.
Jeneng Toonami banjur digunakaké ing &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt; mawa jeneng salah sawijining saluran animasi kang orientasine nggenteni mantan saluran Cartoon Network CNX kang wis dadi jaringan hibrida Toonami/live action. Uga wis dianakake déning 2 pambiwara kang digambar mawa CGI.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Toonami ya iku blok aksi-animasi mligi Cartoon Network. Blok acara iki, digiyaraké wiwit dina &lt;a href="Senin"&gt;Senin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;, kang nggenteni Power Zon, inkarnasi saka blok Super Advebture kang wis dadi pokok jaringan wiwit &lt;a href="1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;. Toonami wiwitane blok kartun lan anime saben sore kang digawakake déning Space Ghost, saka taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="9"&gt;9&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Setu"&gt;Setu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt; Cartoon Network nganyari Toonami mawa tampilan anyar kang ngginakake pesawat absolution lan pambiwara TOM. Iku uga manuhaké Toonami Midnight Run, blok acara tengah wengi kang pisanane blok jam lima sete bengi ing tengah wengi nganti Maret &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, rikala dipindah menyang acara wengi ing format wektu sajam nganti sasi &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Toonami diluncurkan Amérika Latin</h3>
Toonami diluncurkan Amérika Latin.
&lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, Toonami versi &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Latin"&gt;Amérika Latin&lt;/a&gt; diluncurake mawa blok acara Cartoon Network Latin Amérika. Toonami nyiarake acara kang wis tau digiyaraké kaya &lt;a href="Dragon%20Ball%20Z"&gt;Dragon Ball Z&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gundam%20Wing"&gt;Gundam Wing&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Pokemon"&gt;Pokemon&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="Inuyasha"&gt;Inuyasha&lt;/a&gt;. Suwene taun-tahunan, Toonami nambahake acara kaya &lt;a href="YuYu%20Hakusho"&gt;YuYu Hakusho&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saint%20Seiya"&gt;Saint Seiya&lt;/a&gt;, kaya versi saiki saka Cyborg 009 lan &lt;a href="Astro%20Boy."&gt;Astro Boy.&lt;/a&gt;
<h3>Total Immersion Event</h3>
Total Immersion Event.
Diwiwiti September &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, Toonami nyediani interaktif mirunggan kang diwastani mawa Total Immersion Events. TIE pisanan ya iku The Intruder kang dipambiwrani déning SARA.
2 acara kaya Lockdown lan Trapped in Hyperspace nerusaké ngulandharane TON lan SARA, anging tenanan ora nawakake storywise kang akèh.
TIE ing sasi &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt; ya iku ngalihake widangetan saka ngulandharane TOM lan SARA manuhaké prakawis anyar, donya 2D. Immortal Grand Prix diciptakake déning produsen Toonami Sean Akins lan Jason DeMarco sarta digawé déning studio anime Production I.G, ing 5 cicilan cekak lan tugase mawa pambuka kanggi seri Toonami asli kang pisanan ing November 2005.
<h3>Midnight Run</h3>
Midnight Run.
Blok acara kang digiyaraké antawise taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt; iki ana ing jam 00:00 wektu &lt;a href="w%C3%A9tan"&gt;wétan&lt;/a&gt;. Isiné acara kaya &lt;a href="Sailor%20Moon"&gt;Sailor Moon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Voltron"&gt;Voltron&lt;/a&gt;, Rpbotech, Dragon Ball Z, Gundam Wing, G Gundam,Gundam 08th MS Team, dan Outlaw Star. MIdnight Run rada luwih akèh perange dibandingake wektu padinan. Iki ana ing satitik kang ngamot versi Gundam Wing.
<h2>Pambiwara</h2>
Pambiwara.
Wiwitane, Molar saka Space Ghost Coast to Coast ya iku pambiwara acara Toonami. Pungkasane, TOM kang nyekel. Dhèwèké sasuwéné lumaku dikenalake menyang komputer kapal mawa online game kang dikatutake ing jero alur carita kang kedadeyan ing kapal. Diwastani kapal mung amarga matine TOM kang asli ing salah sawijining alur carita iki lan tekane TOM 2, kang peteng lan modele luwih cilik. RIkala akhire ndarat ing Toonami panggonan kang pungkasan ing Setu wengi, kapal iku pungkasane digenteni déning &lt;a href="robot"&gt;robot&lt;/a&gt; lan kanca-kancane.
